From 865c4b95f05896b0c596b4f2cfeba1b066e01ddf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 20:24:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Delete room messages of removed users from MUC archives

Add the `muc.delete_messages_of_removed_users` option to mod_mam. When it
is enabled, the remove_user and anonymous_purge hooks delete the messages
the removed user sent to MUC rooms, which otherwise stay in room archives.

Add the `mam.deleteUserRoomMessages` admin GraphQL command to do the same
on demand, optionally limited to messages archived before a date.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ETaRHXo1LmPHqZB9SXMucM
